  "name": "quorum-submit-dup-guard",
  "title": "quorum_submit refuses duplicate verdict submission for an existing runId",
  "description": "quorum_submit re-emits verdicts on every call under deterministic runIds (storyId-q-rN), so a second invocation at the same material silently appends duplicate verdicts to a runId that already carries a passing quorum. Add a guard that refuses the duplicate while still allowing a fresh quorum after the material changes.",
